sequenceDiagram
    actor Product as Product lead
    actor Engineering as Engineering lead
    participant API as Edge API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor Author
    Product->>API: Approve expected revision and review
    API->>DB: Lock request verify role assignment and readiness
    DB-->>API: Store product approval
    Engineering->>API: Approve same revision and review
    API->>DB: Verify different non-author reviewer and current content
    DB-->>API: Both approvals current
    Author->>API: Generate brief with expected revision
    API->>DB: Lock verify both approvals insert unique brief
    DB-->>API: Existing or newly created immutable brief
    API-->>Author: Brief ID and Markdown download
